{
    "title": "\ubd04\ud230",
    "description": "This is Bomtoon, a webtoon life on a different level from works to morals :)\r\n\r\nIt has been renewed so that you can enjoy webtoons conveniently and enjoy the fun unique to Bomtoon\ud83d\ude06\r\n\u00a0\r\n\u2764 Exclusive webtoon only available on Bomtoon \u2764\r\nA sweet romance webtoon that revives even dead love cells, a daily toon that tells you the calm fun of everyday life, and an indirect fantasy webtoon in the world of dreams, fantasies, and adventures. Only Bomtoon releases masterpieces that webtoon fans want to see.\r\n\r\n\u2764 Free webtoons and discount coupons pouring in every day \u2764\r\nEnjoy a variety of benefits, including a free webtoon gift of 100 episodes every day that can be enjoyed by signing up in just 3 seconds, and half price on your first payment! \ud83d\ude18\r\n\u00a0\r\n[ Renewal ]\r\n\u00a0\r\n\u2764 A PLAY space where you can enjoy and receive gifts every day \u2764\r\nReceive various prizes every day through roulette, which you can participate in just by checking attendance, and receive various benefits that increase the more you play! \ud83d\ude0d\r\n\u00a0\r\n\u2764 Bomtoon Exclusive, Bomtoon Encyclopedia that collects private illustrations \u2764\r\nPick your favorite with the lottery ticket given just for enjoying Bomtoon! Before I knew it, online and offline goods were in my arms~ \ud83d\ude06\r\n\r\n\u2764 Webtoons/comics/novels to enjoy depending on your taste \u2764\r\nDiscover a variety of works including new works/discounts, recommended works, rankings, etc. at each webtoon/comic/novel home!\r\n\u00a0\r\n\u2764 My study that I can decorate as I like with my permanently stored works \u2764\r\nManage your library by creating folders by selecting only the works you like, such as by genre or taste! \ud83d\ude0a\r\n\r\n\u2764 Your personalized viewer \u2764\r\nCustomize your colors, bookmarks, and notes, and set the viewer that suits you to view your work in the optimal environment!\r\n\u00a0\r\n\u203b Information on access rights used in the Bomtoon app\r\n\u00a0\r\n[Optional access rights]\r\n\r\n* Notification: Required to receive information about discounts and events\r\n* Photos and videos (storage space): Required when uploading \u2018Customer Center\u2019 screenshots, required when uploading member \u2018profile\u2019 images, required when downloading \u2018Bomtoon Encyclopedia\u2019 images",
    "descriptionHTML": "This is Bomtoon, a webtoon life on a different level from works to morals :)<br><br>It has been renewed so that you can enjoy webtoons conveniently and enjoy the fun unique to Bomtoon\ud83d\ude06<br>\u00a0<br>\u2764 Exclusive webtoon only available on Bomtoon \u2764<br>A sweet romance webtoon that revives even dead love cells, a daily toon that tells you the calm fun of everyday life, and an indirect fantasy webtoon in the world of dreams, fantasies, and adventures. Only Bomtoon releases masterpieces that webtoon fans want to see.<br><br>\u2764 Free webtoons and discount coupons pouring in every day \u2764<br>Enjoy a variety of benefits, including a free webtoon gift of 100 episodes every day that can be enjoyed by signing up in just 3 seconds, and half price on your first payment! \ud83d\ude18<br>\u00a0<br>[ Renewal ]<br>\u00a0<br>\u2764 A PLAY space where you can enjoy and receive gifts every day \u2764<br>Receive various prizes every day through roulette, which you can participate in just by checking attendance, and receive various benefits that increase the more you play! \ud83d\ude0d<br>\u00a0<br>\u2764 Bomtoon Exclusive, Bomtoon Encyclopedia that collects private illustrations \u2764<br>Pick your favorite with the lottery ticket given just for enjoying Bomtoon! Before I knew it, online and offline goods were in my arms~ \ud83d\ude06<br><br>\u2764 Webtoons/comics/novels to enjoy depending on your taste \u2764<br>Discover a variety of works including new works/discounts, recommended works, rankings, etc. at each webtoon/comic/novel home!<br>\u00a0<br>\u2764 My study that I can decorate as I like with my permanently stored works \u2764<br>Manage your library by creating folders by selecting only the works you like, such as by genre or taste! \ud83d\ude0a<br><br>\u2764 Your personalized viewer \u2764<br>Customize your colors, bookmarks, and notes, and set the viewer that suits you to view your work in the optimal environment!<br>\u00a0<br>\u203b Information on access rights used in the Bomtoon app<br>\u00a0<br>[Optional access rights]<br><br>* Notification: Required to receive information about discounts and events<br>* Photos and videos (storage space): Required when uploading \u2018Customer Center\u2019 screenshots, required when uploading member \u2018profile\u2019 images, required when downloading \u2018Bomtoon Encyclopedia\u2019 images",
